  "description": "Live and die by your fists!\n\nHigh school student Park Ki-Hyun is more confident in his fighting skills than anyone else. He assumed he’d naturally become the center of attention at his new school after transferring— \n\n *“Huh? Knocking someone out in one hit was my specialty, wasn’t it…?”*\n\nThe result? Just one match! Facing an overwhelming opponent, Ki-Hyun’s pride is shattered, and driven by a single-minded determination to win, he eventually steps onto the mat— Hey, let’s have a match!!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
